OL,3,GNEWSAWind farm delay could be end of
OL,4,Ascheme - campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA delay to a planned wind farm in
OL,7,FBronte Country could spell the end of
OL,8,Fthe project, campaigners have said.
OL,10,FDeveloper Calderdale Wind Farm Limited
OL,11,F(CWFL) planned to build 34 turbines on
OL,12,FWalshaw Moor, between Hebden Bridge and
OL,13,FHaworth, but was forced to pause after
OL,14,Fconsultations identified "a number of
OL,15,Fmatters requiring further
OL,16,Fconsideration".
OL,18,FCWFL was due to submit a Development
OL,19,FConsent Order application for
OL,20,FCalderdale Energy Park this month, but
OL,21,Fhas now delayed the application until
OL,22,FJuly 2027.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
