OL,3,GNEWSAWind farm delay could be end of
OL,4,Ascheme - campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Mackinnon, from Stronger Together
OL,7,Fto Stop Calderdale Wind Farm, said
OL,8,Fwhile the project had been forced to
OL,9,Fpause because of safety concerns around
OL,10,Fthe land, the campaign was not yet
OL,11,Fover.
